<title>SPAIN: Spain bond and bill yields higher at auction.</title>
<headline>Spain bond and bill yields higher at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Wednesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> ISSUE  Yield   Pvs	 Price   Pvs    Bid   Allocated</p>
<p> 1-year  5.579  5.315    94.66   94.90  327.01  255.51</p>
<p> 5-year  6.320  6.070   106.90  107.50  244.16  104.06</p>
<p> 15-year 7.155  7.144   114.30  113.80   83.04   16.39</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
